{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>For I, I am He — I put to death</b> — Three times \"I\" in the Masorah, corresponding to three exiles. And \"I,\" corresponding to the fourth exile, as written: ואני בתוך הגולה. To teach that in all the exiles the Holy One, blessed be He, is with us to deliver us." "<b>And none delivers from My hand</b> — מידי in gematria is דין. For none escapes the Day of Judgment."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:18.062742969Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}